*Helm Commands:--

There are two ways to pass Configuration data during install
--set: Specify Override on the command line

--values: specify a YAML file with Overrides
(or-f)
For eg:- helm install mychart stable/tomcat --set service type=Nodeport

helm install testchart stable/Jenkins --set master servicetype=NodePort

